  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“You don’t need that much training…or any, really…”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Kineticist 7th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If your primary element grants a composite blast for having an expanded element with it (such as metal blast for earth), you gain access to that composite blast.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> A fusion kineticist can take this feat a second time at 11th level, applying its effects to their sub element.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
